WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.360
We can't undo the lies we
had to tell girls.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.440
That's just the way it is.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.800
I'm Finn,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.800
Finn Ahern,

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.080
Dennis's son.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.040
How do we know that you are
what you say you are?

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.800
He's dangerous, Val.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.520
You need to be very careful.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.120
I knew my dad,

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.280
he wasn't a murderer.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.040
Then who did it?

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.480
That's what I'm trying to figure out.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.720
We need to stick together.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.640
We give him nothing,

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.880
we tell him nothing.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.560
You want some help?

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.000
Finn?

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.160
This feels personal.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.200
Mom!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.560
I'm sorry.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.680
Go and get him!

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.800
Always been on the outside.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:57.920
Outside looking in.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.360
I want this.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.160
I want you.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.160
I’m doing this for my dad.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:11.280
And I won't stop until I find 
out what you did to him,

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.800
because I know it was you, Val.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.440
It's always you.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:26.120
From now on,
we'll tell each other the truth.

